ca-06017-bos-matter-40478.title:
Health and Human Services Agency (HHSA) recommending the Board:
1) Make findings pursuant to Section 3.13.030 (B) of the El Dorado County Ordinance Chapter 3.13, Contracting Out, that the Animal Services Hearing Officer services performed by Nastich Law require specialty skills and qualifications not expressly identified in County classifications are involved in the performance of the work;
